    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Small parry knife. Brass guard etched with a single word in three languages, all meaning <i>enough</i>.</p><p>Favored by Shadow Couriers. Light enough to draw between sentences.</p><p><b>Quiet Word.</b> While attuned and equipped, you have +1 to Evasion against the first attack each round.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Quiet Word: +1 Evasion vs the first attack each round while attuned and equipped.</p>\n<ul>\n <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d6 Kinetic damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(stab)</span></li>\n <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Intrigue</li>\n <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Melee (Intrigue)</li>\n <li><strong>Reach:</strong> Melee</li>\n <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T1</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->"
    }
